        "Category": "Nimbus Proxy:hub",
        "Subcategory": "Transfers:swap_horiz:2",
        "Description": "Master switch for the seamless handoff path. Off means every transfer is a redirect, whatever a plugin or command asks for.  (Config file key: transfers.allow_seamless)",
